    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fed6b71c7b34abc22b6f8aee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "起初我以为你是出于怜悯，或者是有优越感，这之类的，\r\n但事实似乎并非如此啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a26ff8865de643c9b61602f7a2be7081e6a6c66d6d80263931f564bb694d42a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
