    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51deb61c8936077da09d73db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与空中神宫相遇前，她就已经有一个万能的伙伴了。\n所以即便她现在没有『训练员』，也没什么大不了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a1c4cb01abefdafa735af55cb5ae5d85a04cd754be4e83f594e027ef5853a20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c746f861a671f28f40eacf7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，如果满足于这种没有信任关系的现状，\r\n万一有一天她遇到了自己无法解决的事情――",
      "source_fingerprint": "4690fe84e3ea1181fb30d379e0fa4f4808937dbdb63acc6a66a5576bbc538f74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02371b5c3e70aa48af1839f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，我不想放松这方面的努力",
      "source_fingerprint": "914a67eb7811e7a6d8507ad5411de762c14e3b01435087216b0fdefee42ed3f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f58bf803b0a2220e980a531",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一定只会被拒绝，什么都做不了吧。\n……我这样跟她说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9394c6677ad1ad51fd884d8fb86d5be4da16e685e111037377a756f1f665e863",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
